course: dictionary
lesson: 4099
title: Living fossils: the ginkgo
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A ginkgo is a tall tree with fan-shaped leaves, and it is also a medicine made from those leaves. When you meet a word with two meanings, read the words around it to see which one fits.
explain: «The ginkgo is a living fossil, its family going back about 200 million years.» A living fossil is a living thing from very ancient times. The number of years is a big clue that it is very old.
explain: «Several ginkgo trees ... sprouted again from their roots.» Sprouted means began to grow new shoots. Check by swapping in your meaning: "began to grow new shoots" still makes sense, so you have got it right.
fact: A ginkgo is a tall tree with fan-shaped leaves that turn bright yellow in autumn.
fact: Ginkgo can also mean a medicine or supplement made from the leaves, called ginkgo biloba.
fact: A ginkgo is called a living fossil because trees like it grew in the time of the dinosaurs.
fact: «Biloba» means two lobes, after the split shape of the leaf.
fact: The ginkgo's other name is the maidenhair tree.
exercise: What is a ginkgo? | *A tall tree with fan-shaped leaves | A small flower with red petals | A kind of fish found in rivers
exercise: Why is the ginkgo called a living fossil? | It is a dinosaur bone | It turns into stone in autumn | *Trees like it grew in the time of the dinosaurs
exercise: Find and copy one word from «Several ginkgo trees ... sprouted again from their roots» that means began to grow again. | *sprouted | kilometres | Hiroshima | roots
test: «Ginkgo seeds have a fleshy coat that smells like rancid butter.» What does rancid suggest? | Sweet and fresh | Cool and minty | *Bad, like food gone off | Warm and spicy
test: «The class planted a ginkgo in the playground, and in autumn its leaves turned bright yellow.» In this sentence, what does ginkgo mean? | A fossil rock | A medicine made from leaves | A type of seed | *A tree
exam: Which statement about the ginkgo is true? | Ginkgo trees grow only in the sea | Ginkgos are a kind of dinosaur | All ginkgo trees make seeds | *Only female trees make seeds
